flowchart TD
    START([对局开始]) --> ROLL{随机判断}
    
    ROLL -->|不触发| NORMAL[原有机器人逻辑]
    ROLL -->|触发紧咬| PRESSURE[启用紧咬机器人]
    
    PRESSURE --> INIT[随机生成达标分数 qualify_score]
    
    INIT --> LOOP[加分检查点]
    
    LOOP --> LASTCHECK{是最后一次加分?}
    
    LASTCHECK -->|否 继续紧咬| CALC[target = player_score - 随机分差]
    
    CALC --> COMPARE{target 大于 bot_score?}
    
    COMPARE -->|是| UPDATE[bot_score = target]
    COMPARE -->|否| KEEP[bot_score 不变]
    
    UPDATE --> LOOP
    KEEP --> LOOP
    
    LASTCHECK -->|是 决定输赢| QUALIFY{玩家达标?}
    
    QUALIFY -->|达标| WIN_CALC[计算让玩家赢的加分值]
    QUALIFY -->|未达标| LOSE_CALC[计算让机器人赢的加分值]
    
    WIN_CALC --> FINAL1[机器人最后一次加分]
    LOSE_CALC --> FINAL2[机器人最后一次加分]
    
    FINAL1 --> END1([玩家获胜 险胜])
    FINAL2 --> END2([机器人获胜 惜败])
    NORMAL --> END3([原逻辑结算])

    style PRESSURE fill:#4CAF50,color:white
    style QUALIFY fill:#FF9800,color:white
    style LASTCHECK fill:#E91E63,color:white
    style END1 fill:#2196F3,color:white
    style END2 fill:#f44336,color:white
